R-NM11 R-AD16 R-AD17 R-AD18 R-EC2 R-NM1 R-NM2 R-EV8 (slice 012): an invalid alias is not a prompt: it stops the command in the interactive mode too (TALON_INTERACTIVE=1 and a terminal), with exit 2 and the text that names `--as`. The same 3 runs in the non-interactive mode (CI) are in the L3 case `add/ad1-add-entries`. Run 1: the default alias `9lives` is no name. Run 2: `--as app` is a reserved word. Run 3: `--as pf` is used by the platform entry. The calls.log of the case has no `ask` call, no probe and no write of the project file.
